,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.3, 4.5, 4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9159) - AMD Ryzen 5 5500 (12 threads) - 31.87 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nCalling `font_get_glyph_texture_idx` after setting up shaped text always returns 0 even though calling `font_get_glyph_texture_rid` returns different texture RIDs.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExample code (full setup in MRP):\n```gdscript\nTS.shaped_text_add_string(shaped, \"Aあ啊.．。\", fonts, size)\nvar glyphs := TS.shaped_text_get_glyphs(shaped)\nfor glyph in glyphs:\n    var font_rid := TS.font_get_glyph_texture_rid(glyph.font_rid, sizes, glyph.index)\n    var font_idx := TS.font_get_glyph_texture_idx(glyph.font_rid, sizes, glyph.index)\n    ## font_idx always prints 0 even when font_rid changes\n```\n\nexample output:\n```\nrid=RID(2409476653059) idx=0\nrid=RID(2418066587652) idx=0\nrid=RID(2418066587652) idx=0\nrid=RID(2409476653059) idx=0\nrid=RID(2418066587652) idx=0\nrid=RID(2418066587652) idx=0\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[textserver_idx_always_zero.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24713364/textserver_idx_always_zero.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"chokomancarr","id":6769909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3Njk5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6769909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chokomancarr","html_url":"https://github.com/chokomancarr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chokomancarr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chokomancarr/following{/other_user}","